1. Hypothetical index advisor (HypoPG)
Abhi advisor.py sirf missing FK indexes list karta hai — "shayad ye index chahiye". HypoPG extension se hypothetical index bana kar re-plan kiya ja sakta hai, bina disk pe kuch banaye. Tab output banta hai: "is index se is query ka cost 78% girta hai" — measured, suggestion nahi.
→ Postgres image mein hypopg add karna padega. Ye ek naya lever hai — abhi system sirf plan chun sakta hai, schema fix nahi kar sakta.

2. Drift detection via conformal coverage
Conformal gate promise karta hai "90% outcomes bound ke andar". Agar asli coverage us se girne lage, iska matlab model stale ho gaya — ye principled staleness signal hai. Abhi AUTO_RETRAIN_SECONDS sirf ghadi dekhta hai, data nahi.
→ Machinery already bani hui hai. Retrain ko time-based se evidence-based banata hai.

3. Adaptive candidate budget
Abhi har query ko 20 candidates milte hain — 2ms query ko bhi. Project ka apna documented finding: "optimizer cost 25.2ms to optimize a 21.8ms query". Baseline cost ke hisaab se budget scale ho: sasti query → 3 candidates, mehngi → 25.
→ Sabse kam effort, turant measurable. Seedha optimizer_overhead_ms pe.

4. Richer plan features
Ye documented bottleneck pe direct hit hai. Abhi features = per-table slots + sasta tree encoding. Add: har join level pe estimated rows, selectivity products, depth-wise operator counts, width/buffer estimates. Diagnostics abhi kehta hai "typically off by 43%" — MAE se pehle/baad measure ho jaayega.
→ Agar prediction quality theek karni hai to asli jagah yahi hai. Data ke baad sabse zyada leverage.

5. Per-hint-family regression guard
Abhi guard poori query block karta hai — all-or-nothing. Lekin aksar sirf ek family bura hota hai: Set(enable_hashjoin off) regress karta hai jabki Leading(...) fine hai. Family-level blocking surgical hoga.
→ Aapke screenshot-1 ka plan exactly Set(enable_hashjoin off) tha.

6. Dashboard experiment runner
app.experiment already paired A/B karta hai bootstrap CI + sign test ke saath — par sirf CLI se. UI mein laane se policy/gate comparisons terminal ke bina settle ho sakte.
→ Model behtar nahi karega, par har comparison ko rigorous banata hai.

